## LWJGL's native-library extraction cache, created at runtime when running the client
## (wherever the working directory happened to be when it was run):
.lwjgl/

## Runtime-generated local config, written next to wherever the client/server was launched
## from (the working directory is assets/ when started via the *.cmd helpers). Filled in as
## these files are introduced, see design.md 3.7:
connection-config.json
keybindings.json
audio-settings.json

## Claude Code's per-machine settings:
.claude/settings.local.json

## Test classpath dump for lwjgl3's main()-driven dev tools (GameScreenDriver, ScreenSnapshot, BoardSnapshot),
## generated on demand via `mvn -pl lwjgl3 dependency:build-classpath`:
lwjgl3/cp.txt
